/// M30 HISTORY-055 base semantics: frozen bytes of tests/baseline/baseline.json.
/// Source lock: md5 72bbf9d347920228b9edf83673704d90, 2890 bytes, 1 line.
/// Key pins hold the 7 top-level JSON key spellings in file order.
/// Value pins hold the exact JSON scalar bytes for date, task and revision.
/// Count pins hold ints tallied from the JSON: keys, commands, services,
/// structured trial entries (0; trialAttempt is policy prose) and byte size.
/// Dates and unrun trials stay history; no execution credit is claimed.
/// checks: key-acceptance, key-compiler, key-core-regression, key-date,
/// key-disposable-dirs, key-task, key-toolchain, date-value, task-value,
/// revision-value, key-count, command-count, service-count,
/// trial-entry-count, byte-size.
